  "summary": "Shared sqlglot rendering primitives for the generic write paths: dialect lookup, identifier quoting, literal escaping, qualified names, type rendering, source resolution and projection to the target schema, and two predicate compilers. compile_condition renders an (incoming, existing) -> bool upsert predicate by compiling a sentinel-table join and remapping aliases; compile_index_predicate renders an unqualified partial-index WHERE. Aggregations, window functions and subqueries are rejected.",
